{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/c2390155c446f623912fbf81e2c0176e.poster.avif?t=1770723654\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/c2390155c446f623912fbf81e2c0176e.webm?t=1770723654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/c2390155c446f623912fbf81e2c0176e.mp4?t=1770723654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>LIVING HELL is a 1\u20134 player online co-op horror set in Pelican City. The collapse of the ozone layer was catastrophic and solar radiation triggered widespread, terrifying mutations. As a team, travel into the city at night to bring back specimens for the government\u2019s research AI, DAWN-4o.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">BRING BACK SPECIMENS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/f0c7e025924c44ff6c65602b58c8509c.poster.avif?t=1770723654\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/f0c7e025924c44ff6c65602b58c8509c.webm?t=1770723654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/f0c7e025924c44ff6c65602b58c8509c.mp4?t=1770723654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Deliver mutated samples to DAWN-4o to fuel her research into keeping you alive. Each phase helps her learn and adapt, unlocking new schematics and upgrades. Failure to comply means losing power to your shelter.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">TRUST NO ONE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/ff906518a65605dbde6dd35fe19477e0.poster.avif?t=1770723654\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/ff906518a65605dbde6dd35fe19477e0.webm?t=1770723654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/ff906518a65605dbde6dd35fe19477e0.mp4?t=1770723654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Venturing outside in Pelican City means coming face to face with humans and animals twisted into nightmarish distortions of nature. Their unpredictable behavior will keep you constantly looking over your shoulder. Just remember that nobody is immune to the radiation's mutating effects.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">RACE THE SUN</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/c15336a334b20fa3590bf594f52c0acb.poster.avif?t=1770723654\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/c15336a334b20fa3590bf594f52c0acb.webm?t=1770723654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/c15336a334b20fa3590bf594f52c0acb.mp4?t=1770723654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Scavenge for essential supplies by night while managing your Thermal Load with hydration. Escape to your shelter before the sun rises or be consumed by blistering solar radiation.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">EXPLORE PELICAN CITY</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/cbdebf2edabf76f659a7445928ebc518.poster.avif?t=1770723654\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/cbdebf2edabf76f659a7445928ebc518.webm?t=1770723654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/cbdebf2edabf76f659a7445928ebc518.mp4?t=1770723654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Travel by subway to hand-crafted districts, each with multiple building interiors and layouts that change every run. Immerse yourself in the charred ruins of a once thriving modern city where danger now lurks around every corner.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">TOGETHER OR ALONE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/8a35e83365aa153e79360981bccbdb28.poster.avif?t=1770723654\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/8a35e83365aa153e79360981bccbdb28.webm?t=1770723654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/8a35e83365aa153e79360981bccbdb28.mp4?t=1770723654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose from 8 playable characters with unique passive abilities. Proximity chat, walkie-talkies, shared storage, and persistent saves. Feeling brave? Venture into the city alone in offline single-player mode.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">SCAVENGE AND CRAFT</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/8615c372a4de49f629600a8d5d145f4b.poster.avif?t=1770723654\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/8615c372a4de49f629600a8d5d145f4b.webm?t=1770723654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/8615c372a4de49f629600a8d5d145f4b.mp4?t=1770723654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Find materials to craft weapons, tools, and consumables to keep you and your team alive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Six hand-crafted city districts with building interior layouts that change each run<br></li><li>Eight playable characters with unique passives<br></li><li>More than a dozen mutated creatures with varied behaviors<br></li><li>Crafting and inventory systems inspired by classic survival horror<br></li><li>Immersive proximity voice chat with lip-sync<br></li><li>Persistent save files across sessions<br></li><li>Full gamepad and Steam Deck support<br></li><li>Unique mix of retro-inspired visuals and modern rendering for immersive gameplay with high performance<br></li><li>Client prediction and lag-compensation network systems for snappy combat<br></li><li>Original score by Phoenix Glendinning</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3078760?t=1770723654","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/45253972d0959eeec3b207ace1c0b8e5dec220c3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770723654","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/ef609dcf590183b6869993e447784b9501696e1a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770723654","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/ef609dcf590183b6869993e447784b9501696e1a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770723654","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Fam